# Passport Photo Size in India

Passport and application photograph requirements can vary depending on the document and authority.

A commonly used format is **35 × 45 mm**, but this does not mean that every Indian application uses the same dimensions.

Always check the latest instructions provided by the specific government department, embassy, passport authority, examination board, university, company or website where you are submitting the photograph.

Tools24 provides preset and custom sizing options to help users prepare photographs according to known requirements.

